80	                        "c-r4-ok", id, 4, true, end, null));
81	            });
82	            // B：窗口结束时刻巡检（恰终点），若仍有未完成步骤 -> WINDOW_EXPIRED 强制回退
83	            Future<Object> fb = pool.submit(() -> {
