Publish logic:

```java
@Transactional
public BatchActionResult publish(PublishBatchRequest req) {
    String fp = fingerprintPublish(req);
    CutoverBatchPO existing = batchRepo.findBatch(req.requestId());
    if (existing != null) {
        return resolvePublishIdempotent(existing, fp);
    }

    // 结构校验：成员唯一、边两端在批内、无自环、无环
    List<BatchMemberRef> members = req.members();
    Set<String> memberIds = new HashSet<>();
    for (BatchMemberRef m : members) {
        if (!memberIds.add(m.requestId())) {
            throw new BusinessRuleException("批次成员必须唯一，重复成员: " + m.requestId());
        }
    }
    List<BatchEdgeRef> edges = req.edges() == null ? List.of() : req.edges();
    Set<String> edgeKeys = new HashSet<>();
    for (BatchEdgeRef e : edges) {
        if (e.predecessor().equals(e.successor())) {
            throw new BusinessRuleException("依赖边不允许自环: " + e.predecessor());
        }
        if (!memberIds.contains(e.predecessor()) || !memberIds.contains(e.successor())) {
            throw new BusinessRuleException("依赖边两端必须都在批内: " + e.predecessor() + "->" + e.successor());
        }
        if (!edgeKeys.add(e.predecessor() + "->" + e.successor())) {
            throw new BusinessRuleException("依赖边重复: " ...);
        }
    }
    // 环检测（Kahn 或 DFS）
    detectCycle(memberIds, edges);

    // 锁定成员申请行（按申请编号升序，避免死锁），校验状态/版本/批次占用
    List<String> sortedIds = memberIds.stream().sorted().toList();
    Map<String, CutoverRequestPO> locked = new LinkedHashMap<>();
    for (String id : sortedIds) {
        CutoverRequestPO po = cutoverRepo.lockRequest(id);
        if (po == null) throw new NotFoundException("割接申请不存在: " + id);
        locked.put(id, po);
    }
    // 拿锁后复查幂等：并发同 batchId 可能已提交
    CutoverBatchPO afterLock = batchRepo.findBatch(req.requestId());
    if (afterLock != null) return resolvePublishIdempotent(afterLock, fp);

    Map<String, Integer> expectedVersions = members -> map
    for each member:
        po status must be APPROVED else 422 ("已批准但未开始" — APPROVED only; EXECUTING or other → 422)
        version match expectedVersion else 422
        batchRepo.findOpenMembership(id) != null → 422 一项申请最多属于一个未结束批次

    // 插入批次+成员+边+事件
    ...
    insertBatch with try/catch DuplicateKeyException → resolve
}
```

Cycle detection: DFS with colors or Kahn. Kahn: indegree map; repeatedly remove zero-indegree; if remaining > 0 → cycle → 422.

Wait — should structural issues be 400 or 422? I decided 422 (BusinessRuleException) for semantic issues. Duplicate members/self-loop/cycle/edge-outside → 422. Bean validation handles blank/null → 400. Document in final report.

Fingerprint: structured via FingerprintUtil.sha256 with nested lists:

```java
private String fingerprintPublish(PublishBatchRequest req) {
    List<List<Object>> members = req.members().stream()
        .map(m -> List.<Object>of(m.requestId(), m.expectedVersion()))
        .sorted(comparing by requestId string)
        .toList();
    List<List<Object>> edges = (req.edges()==null?List.<BatchEdgeRef>of():req.edges()).stream()
        .map(e -> List.<Object>of(e.predecessor(), e.successor()))
        .sorted(...)
        .toList();
    return FingerprintUtil.sha256("BATCH_PUBLISH", req.requestId(), req.batchName(),
            req.publishTime(), members, edges);
}
```

Sorting before fingerprint makes fingerprint order-independent for collections — good (same set, different order → same params). Sorting by string representation: sort members by (String)requestId; edges by predecessor then successor. Since lists contain Lists, Comparator.comparing(l -> (String)l.get(0)).thenComparing(...get(1) as string? version is Integer — compare via String.valueOf). Simpler: sort BatchMemberRef list first by requestId, then map. And edges sorted by predecessor then successor.

JSON serialization of LocalDateTime: FingerprintUtil's MAPPER has JavaTimeModule. Good.

Insert batch: version=1, status PUBLISHED. Members: request_version = po.getVersion(), window snapshot from po, member_status READY. Edges inserted. Event: insertEvent via cutoverRepo — CutoverRepository.insertEvent exists; I need CutoverEventPO construction. CutoverService has private insertEvent; I'll build the event in BatchService directly using cutoverRepo.insertEvent with try/catch DuplicateKeyException similar pattern. request_uid = "BATCH-PUBLISH-" + batchId, request_id = batchId, event_type BATCH_PUBLISH, payload_fingerprint = fp, result_snapshot JSON {"message": ...}.

Replay: resolvePublishIdempotent(existing, fp): if !existing.getFingerprint().equals(fp) → 409 ConflictException. Else return new BatchActionResult(true, "同键同参重放，返回首次冻结结果", toView(existing)).

get(batchId): find batch, 404 if null; build view: members sorted (repo sorts), edges sorted; blockSources split by comma.

blocks(batchId): 404 if batch missing; members with memberStatus BLOCKED → BlockDetailView(batchId, requestId, sources).

